    "text": "For a moving coil galvanometer. <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>175</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>180</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>",
